1) please do not top-post

2) please do not thread-hijack

3) Any BIOS should do, although some functionality may or may not be
available depending on it. If you can change BIOS'es on your system,
the only thing you can do is try - there is no known good list of
BIOS'es. In doubt, please ask your hardware vendor about PowerTOP
support.

